| GoalSource | goals | FEATURE_GOAL_SYSTEM（env 默认 true） | ✅ |
| KnowledgeSource | knowledge | FEATURE_KNOWLEDGE_PLATFORM（env 默认 true） | ✅ |
| PersonalContextSource | context/personal_context_source.py | FEATURE_PERSONAL_CONTEXT=True | ✅ |
| PersonalAISource | context/personal_ai_source.py | FEATURE_PERSONAL_AI=True | ✅ |
| MemoryRecallSource | memory_intelligence | FEATURE_MEMORY_INTELLIGENCE=True | ✅ |
| PerceptionSource | context/perception_source.py | FEATURE_PERCEPTION_CONTEXT=False | ❌ |
